values ($lx$michael-lee-md-phoenix$lx$, (select id from public.business_categories where slug = $lx$medical$lx$), $lx$Michael Lee, MD (Banner MD Anderson)$lx$, null, $lx$Hematologist and medical oncologist with Banner, speaking Cantonese and Mandarin, accepting new patients.$lx$, $lx$Banner 血液腫瘤科醫師，可說粵語及國語，目前接受新病患。$lx$, $lx$Dr. Michael Lee is a hematologist and medical oncologist at Banner University Medical Center Phoenix, 1111 E McDowell Rd, and is also listed at Banner Ocotillo Medical Center in Chandler and Banner MD Anderson Cancer Center sites in Phoenix, Mesa and Gilbert. Dr. Lee treats adults and is accepting new patients. Dr. Lee earned a medical degree at the University of Massachusetts Medical School, completed a residency at Yale New Haven Hospital and a fellowship at the University of California San Francisco, and is board certified in hematology. Dr. Lee speaks Cantonese, Mandarin and English. The phone number is the Banner MD Anderson scheduling line shown on the Banner profile. Languages as listed in Banner Health's Find a Doctor directory, checked November 2026.$lx$, $lx$Michael Lee 醫師是血液科及腫瘤內科醫師，在鳳凰城 1111 E McDowell Rd 的 Banner University Medical Center Phoenix 看診，也列於錢德勒的 Banner Ocotillo Medical Center，以及鳳凰城、梅薩和吉爾伯特的 Banner MD Anderson 癌症中心據點。看診對象為成人，目前接受新病患。Lee 醫師畢業於麻薩諸塞大學醫學院，在耶魯紐哈芬醫院完成住院醫師訓練，並在加州大學舊金山分校完成專科研修，持有血液科專科認證。能說粵語、國語及英語。電話為 Banner 醫師頁面所列的 Banner MD Anderson 預約專線。語言資訊依據 Banner Health「Find a Doctor」醫師名錄，2026 年 11 月查核。$lx$, $lx$Phoenix$lx$, $lx$Greater Phoenix$lx$, $lx$1111 E McDowell Rd, Phoenix, AZ 85006$lx$, null, $lx$(480) 256-6444$lx$, null, $lx$https://doctors.bannerhealth.com/provider/michael-lee/1407594$lx$, array[$lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$Cantonese$lx$]::text[], array[$lx$Michael Lee, MD (Banner MD Anderson)$lx$, $lx$Phoenix$lx$, $lx$medical$lx$, $lx$doctors.bannerhealth.com$lx$, $lx$English$lx$, $lx$Mandarin$lx$, $lx$Cantonese$lx$, $lx$doctor physician$lx$, $lx$醫師 看診$lx$, $lx$Chinese-speaking$lx$, $lx$中文服務$lx$]::text